@ai = http://localhost:5063
@rag = http://localhost:5070
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Policy search on Invoice.RAG
GET {{rag}}/api/v1/policies/search?query=over-receipt tolerance&topK=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Rules + vendor data in one Invoice.AI request
POST {{ai}}/api/v1/ai/vendor/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questions": [
    "Who must approve a PO of 18,000?",
    "What are the payment terms of VEND008?",
    "Can a PO be cancelled after goods were received?"
  ]
}

### 3. Invoice check with numbers
POST {{ai}}/api/v1/ai/vendor/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "A vendor invoice is 10,080. The PO total is 10,000 and 10,000 was received (100 of 100 units). Can we pay it?" }

### 4. Rules inside the RAG agent
POST {{rag}}/api/v1/agent/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "questions": ["What is the over-receipt tolerance?", "Which vendors have Net 45 payment terms?"] }
